      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Supporting the Act risks alienating stakeholders who believe avoiding political commentary protects the company, but it could also build trust with environmentally conscious customers by showing proactive responsibility. Remaining neutral lets the firm sidestep perceived political entanglements but may reinforce accusations of complicity, potentially exacerbating brand fragmentation. Given the current public sentiment, a transparent statement outlining your commitment to these standards without taking a hardline political stance often balances transparency with strategic clarity.",
